 "notes": "The DOR specialty page now renders a full image gallery (272 non-motorcycle designs, including dealer/government/truck types); every image URL above is the full-size original (the page shows styles/medium .webp copies) and loaded in the browser. The double-encoded '%2520' names are the real file names. 'Retired' = in the game but absent from this full gallery: retired-military plates, National Guard - State, Special National Guard (a 'National Guard - Special' remains), Veterans of the US Armed Forces, Ambulance, and Blair E Batson (superseded by Friends of Children's Hospital). Also absent but left out of 'retired' as non-passenger/government: Department of Transportation, Mississippi Department of Transportation, Farm Carriers/Property Carrier over 10,000 GVW, B-10 and F-10 (the gallery has B10/F10 Blackout and B16-B80/F16-F80 instead), and Antique (now Antique Car/Truck). Juvenile Diabetes and Merchant Marine may just be variants of game plates (see matches_existing). The school-district plates likely date from 2023-25 but the page gives no dates; Blackout Passenger is the 2024-2029 series."
